  "label": "Use of Vulgar Language",
  "description": "The phrase 'dude blew his tranny???' uses crude, offensive language to create shock value and humor. The term 'tranny' is a vulgar slang term for 'transmission' in automotive contexts, but it is also a derogatory slur used against transgender people. The meme relies on the viewer understanding the double meaning and the taboo nature of the language to generate its intended effect, which may be offensive to some audiences.",
